  "news.ai_tutors.sum": ["Teachers get marked work and a draft lesson plan for every class each morning.", "Guru menerima kerja yang telah ditanda dan draf rancangan pelajaran untuk setiap kelas setiap pagi.", "老师每天早上收到已批改的作业和每个班的教案草稿。"],
  "news.ai_tutors.title": ["AI tutors mark homework and plan lessons", "Tutor AI menanda kerja rumah dan merancang pelajaran", "AI 辅导员批改作业并备课"],
  "news.auto_bookkeeping.sum": ["Invoices, bank feeds and receipts are matched and reconciled without anyone typing them in.", "Invois, penyata bank dan resit dipadankan dan disesuaikan tanpa sesiapa menaipnya.", "发票、银行流水和收据自动匹配对账，无需人工录入。"],
  "news.auto_bookkeeping.title": ["AI closes the monthly books", "AI menutup akaun bulanan", "AI 完成每月结账"],
  "news.clinical_scribes.sum": ["The assistant listens to the consultation and drafts the notes and the referral letter.", "Pembantu mendengar konsultasi dan mendraf nota serta surat rujukan.", "助手听完问诊后起草病历和转诊信。"],
  "news.clinical_scribes.title": ["AI scribes now write clinical notes", "Jurutulis AI kini menulis nota klinikal", "AI 记录员开始撰写临床病历"],
  "news.coding_agents.sum": ["Agents plan, write, test and merge a feature from one request.", "Ejen merancang, menulis, menguji dan menggabungkan satu ciri daripada satu permintaan.", "智能体从一句需求出发，自己规划、编写、测试并合并一个功能。"],
  "news.coding_agents.title": ["AI coding agents now ship whole features", "Ejen pengekodan AI kini menyiapkan ciri penuh", "AI 编程智能体现在能独立交付完整功能"],
  "news.data_agents.sum": ["Ask in plain words; the agent queries, cleans, charts and explains the data.", "Tanya dalam bahasa biasa; ejen membuat pertanyaan, membersih, mencarta dan menerangkan data.", "用大白话提问，智能体自己查询、清洗、制图并解读数据。"],
  "news.data_agents.title": ["AI analysts go from a question to a finished dashboard", "Penganalisis AI pergi daripada soalan terus ke papan pemuka siap", "AI 分析师从一个问题直接做出完整仪表盘"],
  "news.design_generators.sum": ["A short brief becomes posters, social posts and a short video in seconds.", "Ringkasan pendek menjadi poster, hantaran media sosial dan video pendek dalam beberapa saat.", "一份简短的简报几秒内变成海报、社交帖子和短视频。"],
  "news.design_generators.title": ["Design tools generate whole campaigns from a brief", "Alat reka bentuk menjana kempen lengkap daripada ringkasan", "设计工具根据简报生成整套宣传"],
  "news.h": ["Publish a piece of AI news", "Terbitkan satu berita AI", "发布一条 AI 新闻"],
  "news.legal_drafting.sum": ["A first draft and the relevant cases arrive in minutes; lawyers review and argue.", "Draf pertama dan kes berkaitan siap dalam beberapa minit; peguam menyemak dan berhujah.", "几分钟内就有初稿和相关判例；律师负责审阅和出庭辩论。"],
  "news.legal_drafting.title": ["AI drafts contracts and finds the case law", "AI mendraf kontrak dan mencari undang-undang kes", "AI 起草合同并检索判例"],
  "news.p": ["Pick a headline. The same pipeline as the real data runs on a changed copy, and everything comes back before and after. Nothing is saved.", "Pilih satu tajuk berita. Saluran yang sama seperti data sebenar dijalankan pada salinan yang diubah, dan semuanya dipaparkan sebelum dan selepas. Tiada apa disimpan.", "选一条标题。和真实数据同一条管线会在一份改动过的副本上重跑，所有结果都给出前后对比。不保存任何东西。"],
  "news.service_agents.sum": ["Customers get answers, refunds and bookings from an AI agent; people take the hard cases.", "Pelanggan mendapat jawapan, bayaran balik dan tempahan daripada ejen AI; manusia mengendalikan kes sukar.", "顾客从 AI 客服获得解答、退款和预订；人工处理疑难个案。"],
