  "scn.estimate": ["Estimates, not predictions", "Anggaran, bukan ramalan", "估计，不是预言"],
  "scn.estimate.long": ["These are estimates under an assumption about how fast AI spreads, not predictions. The choice is yours.", "Ini anggaran berdasarkan andaian tentang kepantasan AI tersebar, bukan ramalan. Pilihan di tangan anda.", "这些是在“AI 普及有多快”这一假设下的估计，不是预言。怎么选由你决定。"],
  "scn.fast": ["Fast AI adoption", "Penggunaan AI pantas", "AI 普及快"],
  "scn.fast.desc": ["AI agents become normal at work: about half of the gap closes by 2030.", "Ejen AI menjadi kebiasaan di tempat kerja: kira-kira separuh jurang ditutup menjelang 2030.", "AI 智能体成为工作常态：到 2030 年大约走完一半。"],
