  "srcs.f.demand.code": ["50 + 50 × weighted mean of: MyCOL (yes 1, near 0.5, no 0) and the change in the major group's share of online job ads ÷ {0}%", "50 + 50 × purata berwajaran: MyCOL (ya 1, hampir 0.5, tidak 0) dan perubahan bahagian iklan kerja dalam talian kumpulan utama ÷ {0}%", "50 + 50 × 加权平均：MyCOL（是 1、接近 0.5、否 0）与所属大类网络招聘广告占比变化 ÷ {0}%"],
